# C18 (spec 2.3). Sign in with auth.http first; convert a few files with convert.http/images.http.
# Own history needs transformations@history; another user's needs transformations@history_any.
@targetUserId = <another-user-id>
@cursor = <nextCursor-from-the-previous-page>

### Own history, newest first: 200 {items, nextCursor}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transformations/history?limit=2

### The next page: the cursor only works with the same limit and filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transformations/history?limit=2&cursor={{cursor}}

### The same cursor with another limit: 400 invalid_cursor
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transformations/history?limit=3&cursor={{cursor}}

### Filters: type, formats, status, period (from inclusive, to exclusive, UTC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transformations/history?type=image&status=success&createdAtFrom=2026-11-01T00:00:00Z

### An invalid filter: 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transformations/history?status=pending

### Someone's history (admin): 200, 403 without history_any, 404 for an unknown user
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{targetUserId}}/transformations/history?limit=20
